1





      {⍵⊢'1' ⎕EA '→1'}⍬
1





      {⍵⊢'1' ⎕EB '→1'}⍬
SYNTAX ERROR+
λ1[1]  λ←⍵⊢'1' ⎕EB '→1'
           ^





